    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.starter\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nthis is the error\n```\nError detected while processing CursorMoved Autocommands for \"<buffer=1>\":\nError executing lua callback: ...ah/.local/share/nvim/lazy/mini.nvim/lua/mini/starter.lua:1252: Cursor position outside buffer\nstack traceback:\n        [C]: in function 'nvim_win_set_cursor'\n        ...ah/.local/share/nvim/lazy/mini.nvim/lua/mini/starter.lua:1252: in function 'position_cursor_on_current_item'\n        ...ah/.local/share/nvim/lazy/mini.nvim/lua/mini/starter.lua:1320: in function <...ah/.local/share/nvim/lazy/mini.nvim/l\nua/mini/starter.lua:1320>\n```\nRunning `:e` on clean neovim says `E32: No filename`\n\n### Reproduction\n\n1. open neovim with mini.starter installed and enabled\n2. run `:e`",
